{
  "id": "bulk_modulus_and_fluid_elasticities",
  "title": "Bulk Modulus and Fluid Elasticities",
  "description": "Calculate bulk modulus elasticity and fluid compressibility properties. The bulk modulus characterizes how easy a unit volume of fluid can be changed when changing pressure. Use volume-based or density-based calculations.",
  "type": "datatable",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# Bulk Modulus and Fluid Elasticities Calculator\n\nThe Bulk Modulus Elasticity (Volume Modulus) is a material property characterizing the compressibility of a fluid.\n\n## Calculation Methods\n\n### Method 1: Volume-Based\nK = - dp / (dV / V0) = - (p1 - p0) / ((V1 - V0) / V0)\n\n### Method 2: Density-Based\nK = dp / (dρ / ρ0) = (p1 - p0) / ((ρ1 - ρ0) / ρ0)\n\nWhere:\n- K = Bulk Modulus of Elasticity (Pa, N/m²)\n- dp = differential change in pressure (Pa, N/m²)\n- p0 = initial pressure (Pa, N/m²)\n- p1 = final pressure (Pa, N/m²)\n- V0 = initial volume (m³)\n- V1 = final volume (m³)\n- ρ0 = initial density (kg/m³)\n- ρ1 = final density (kg/m³)"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "method",
          "label": "Calculation Method",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": "volume",
              "label": "Volume-Based"
            },
            {
              "value": "density",
              "label": "Density-Based"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": "volume"
        },
        {
          "id": "p0",
          "label": "Initial Pressure (p0)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "defaultValue": 101325
        },
        {
          "id": "p1",
          "label": "Final Pressure (p1)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "defaultValue": 110000000
        },
        {
          "id": "V0",
          "label": "Initial Volume (V0)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m³",
          "defaultValue": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "V1",
          "label": "Final Volume (V1)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "m³",
          "defaultValue": 0.99
        },
        {
          "id": "rho0",
          "label": "Initial Density (ρ0)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/m³",
          "defaultValue": 1022
        },
        {
          "id": "rho1",
          "label": "Final Density (ρ1)",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "kg/m³",
          "defaultValue": 1070
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "K_volume",
          "label": "Bulk Modulus (Volume Method)",
          "formula": "-(inputs.p1 - inputs.p0) / ((inputs.V1 - inputs.V0) / inputs.V0)",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "format": "scientific"
        },
        {
          "id": "K_density",
          "label": "Bulk Modulus (Density Method)",
          "formula": "(inputs.p1 - inputs.p0) / ((inputs.rho1 - inputs.rho0) / inputs.rho0)",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "format": "scientific"
        },
        {
          "id": "K_GPa",
          "label": "Bulk Modulus",
          "formula": "(inputs.p1 - inputs.p0) / ((inputs.rho1 - inputs.rho0) / inputs.rho0) / 1e9",
          "unit": "GPa",
          "format": "decimal"
        },
        {
          "id": "dp",
          "label": "Pressure Change (dp)",
          "formula": "inputs.p1 - inputs.p0",
          "unit": "Pa",
          "format": "scientific"
        },
        {
          "id": "drho",
          "label": "Density Change (dρ)",
          "formula": "inputs.rho1 - inputs.rho0",
          "unit": "kg/m³",
          "format": "decimal"
        }
      ]
    },
